{"c":[{"name":"20261023T010854Z-5c910d697bfc5d76","text":"Puck shadow of constrain-size-as-best-we-can at ce16489 (fresh clone, make sync, no --with) exited 0: every phase passed, copy stayed v1.0.0+, DuckDB 1.5.4 wrote it, no nanobind line.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261023T012807Z-7941fa66d7075fa2","text":"Operator 2026-10-22: released migrations are never rewritten; 0003 returns as shipped. No runner rule may record a version unrun. DuckDB 2.0.0: released 0003 needs explicit INSTALL/LOAD vss (no autoload); a kill after 0003 reopens without vss and 0009 drops the index.","type":"note"}]}
